parts.text:
The print dispatch worked! But wait - it sent a PNG file, not a processed PDF. The `processFile` function only processes PDFs - for other files it just returns the raw storage path. Let me check:

```js
async function processFile(file, pageRange, settings) {
  const ext = path.extname(file.originalName).toLowerCase();

  if (ext === '.pdf') {
    return processPDF(file, pageRange, settings);
  }

  return file.storagePath;
}
