});
if (result.success) {
    setUploadedOrder(result.data);
    toast.success(`${result.data.files?.length || 0} file(s) analyzed!`);
```

The `result` is `response.data`, which is `{ success: true, data: { order: { ... }, files: [...] } }`. Wait, looking at the guest upload route:

