Actually, for the pricing module, the function receives the rate values from the config which comes from the DB settings (stored as `bwPerPage`, `colorPerPage`, `colorDuplexPerPage` in the PricingRule model). The labels are just for the display breakdown. I'll keep the DB keys as they are but change the logic to be per-sheet.

