- `processPDF` extracts these into a new 6-page PDF
- `dispatchPrintJob` tells the printer: print pages "5,6,7,8,9,10" → Wrong! The PDF only has 6 pages

The fix: the processed PDF already contains only the right pages. Remove the pages restriction entirely.

