parts.text:
Got it. Let me design a **production-grade SaaS architecture** that handles 50+ shops, looks professional, and scales. No compromises.

---

## 🏗️ Patel AutoPrint - Professional SaaS Architecture

### **Tech Stack**

| Layer | Technology | Why |
|-------|-----------|-----|
| **Runtime** | Node.js 24 LTS | Fast, mature, great ecosystem |
| **Framework** | Fastify 5 | 2x faster than Express, built-in schema validation |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL 16 | ACID, JSON support, scalable |
| **ORM** | Prisma 6 | Type-safe, migrations, great DX |
| **Cache** | Redis 7 | Sessions, pub/sub, rate limiting |
| **Queue** | BullMQ | Job processing, retries, scheduling |
| **Real-time** | Socket.io | WebSocket with fallback |
| **Storage** | AWS S3 / MinIO | File uploads, backups |
| **CDN** | CloudFront / BunnyCDN | Fast global delivery |
| **Auth** | JWT + API Keys | Stateless, scalable |
| **Payments** | Razorpay / Stripe | Subscriptions, webhooks |
| **WhatsApp** | Meta Business API | Official, reliable |
| **Monitoring** | Prometheus + Grafana | Metrics, alerts |
| **Logging** | Pino + ELK | Structured logs, search |
| **Docker** | Multi-stage builds | Production-ready containers |
| **CI/CD** | GitHub Actions | Automated testing & deploy |

---

## 📁 Project Structure (Modular Monolith → Microservices)

```
patel-autoprint/
├── apps/
│   ├── api/                    # Main API server (Fastify)
│   │   ├── src/
│   │   │   ├── modules/        # Feature modules
│   │   │   │   ├── auth/       # Authentication
│   │   │   │   ├── shops/      # Shop management
│   │   │   │   ├── orders/     # Order processing
│   │   │   │   ├── printers/   # Printer management
│   │   │   │   ├── payments/   # Subscriptions & billing
│   │   │   │   ├── files/      # File processing
│   │   │   │   ├── whatsapp/   # WhatsApp bot
│   │   │   │   ├── analytics/  # Stats & reports
│   │   │   │   └── agent/      # Desktop agent API
│   │   │   ├── plugins/        # Fastify plugins
│   │   │   ├── queues/         # BullMQ queues
│   │   │   ├── sockets/        # Socket.io handlers
│   │   │   └── app.ts          # App builder
│   │   └── package.json
│   │
│   ├── worker/                 # Background job processor
│   │   ├── src/
│   │   │   ├── processors/     # Job processors
│   │   │   └── worker.ts       # Worker entry
│   │   └── package.json
│   │
│   └── web/                    # Customer portal (React)
│       ├── src/
│       └── package.json
│
├── packages/
│   ├── shared/                 # Shared types & utilities
│   │   ├── src/
│   │   │   ├── types/          # TypeScript types
│   │   │   ├── constants/      # Enums, configs
│   │   │   └── utils/          # Helper functions
│   │   └── package.json
│   │
│   └── prisma/                 # Database schema & client
│       ├── schema.prisma
│       ├── migrations/
│       └── package.json
│
├── docker-compose.yml          # Local development
├── Dockerfile                  # Production build
├── k8s/                        # Kubernetes manifests
│   ├── api-deployment.yaml
│   ├── worker-deployment.yaml
│   └── redis.yaml
│
└── turbo.json                  # Monorepo orchestration
```

---

## 🗄️ Database Schema (Prisma)

```prisma
// packages/prisma/schema.prisma

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
  previewFeatures = ["fullTextSearch", "trisen"]
}

datasource db {
  provider = "postgresql"
  url      = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

// ============================================
// SUBSCRIPTION & BILLING
// ============================================

model Plan {
  id            String   @id @default(cuid())
  name          String   @unique // "Basic", "Pro", "Enterprise"
  priceMonthly  Int      // in paise (₹999 = 99900)
  priceYearly   Int
  features      Json     // { maxOrders: 1000, maxPrinters: 5, whatsapp: true }
  isActive      Boolean  @default(true)
  createdAt     DateTime @default(now())

  subscriptions Subscription[]
}

model Subscription {
  id                   String   @id @default(cuid())
  shopId               String   @unique
  planId               String
  status               SubscriptionStatus @default(TRIAL)
  razorpaySubscriptionId String?
  razorpayCustomerId     String?
  trialEndsAt          DateTime?
  currentPeriodStart   DateTime?
  currentPeriodEnd     DateTime?
  cancelAtPeriodEnd    Boolean  @default(false)
  createdAt            DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt            DateTime @updatedAt

  shop                 Shop @relation(fields: [shopId], references: [id])
  plan                 Plan @relation(fields: [planId], references: [id])
  invoices             Invoice[]
}

enum SubscriptionStatus {
  TRIAL
  ACTIVE
  PAST_DUE
  CANCELLED
  EXPIRED
}

model Invoice {
  id              String   @id @default(cuid())
  subscriptionId  String
  razorpayInvoiceId String?
  amount          Int
  status          InvoiceStatus @default(PENDING)
  paidAt          DateTime?
  invoiceUrl      String?
  createdAt       DateTime @default(now())

  subscription    Subscription @relation(fields: [subscriptionId], references: [id])
}

enum InvoiceStatus {
  PENDING
  PAID
  FAILED
  REFUNDED
}

// ============================================
// SHOP & USER MANAGEMENT
// ============================================

model Shop {
  id            String   @id @default(cuid())
  name          String
  ownerName     String
  mobile        String
  email         String?
  address       String?
  city          String?
  state         String?
  pincode       String?
  gstNumber     String?

  // Activation
  activationKey String   @unique // XRB-XXXX-XXXX
  isActivated   Boolean  @default(false)
  activatedAt   DateTime?

  // Branding
  logoUrl       String?
  primaryColor  String   @default("#1976d2")

  // Settings (stored as JSON for flexibility)
  settings      Json     @default("{}")

  // Relations
  users         User[]
  orders        Order[]
  printers      Printer[]
  customers     Customer[]
  pricingRules  PricingRule[]
  printJobs     PrintJob[]
  whatsappSession WhatsAppSession?
  files         File[]

  createdAt     DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt     DateTime @updatedAt

  @@index([activationKey])
  @@index([isActivated])
}

model User {
  id           String   @id @default(cuid())
  shopId       String
  email        String
  passwordHash String
  name         String
  role         String   @default("OWNER") // OWNER, MANAGER, OPERATOR
  isActive     Boolean  @default(true)
  lastLoginAt  DateTime?
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())

  shop         Shop     @relation(fields: [shopId], references: [id])

  @@unique([shopId, email])
  @@index([shopId])
}

// ============================================
// DESKTOP AGENT
// ============================================

model Agent {
  id              String   @id @default(cuid())
  shopId          String
  machineName     String   // "COUNTER-1", "BACKOFFICE"
  machineId       String   @unique // UUID generated on install
  apiKey          String   @unique // Agent auth token
  version         String   @default("1.0.0")
  isActive        Boolean  @default(true)
  lastHeartbeatAt DateTime?
  ipAddress       String?
  osInfo          String?

  shop            Shop     @relation(fields: [shopId], references: [id])
  sessions        AgentSession[]

  createdAt       DateTime @default(now())

  @@index([shopId])
  @@index([machineId])
  @@index([apiKey])
}

model AgentSession {
  id          String   @id @default(cuid())
  agentId     String
  startedAt   DateTime @default(now())
  endedAt     DateTime?
  jobsProcessed Int    @default(0)
  errors      Int      @default(0)

  agent       Agent    @relation(fields: [agentId], references: [id])

  @@index([agentId])
}

// ============================================
// PRINTER MANAGEMENT
// ============================================

model Printer {
  id            String   @id @default(cuid())
  shopId        String
  name          String   // "Canon 6575", "Konica C458"
  ip            String?
  port          Int      @default(9100)
  model         String?

  // Capabilities
  colorSupport  Boolean  @default(false)
  duplexSupport Boolean  @default(false)
  paperSizes    String[] @default(["A4"])

  // Settings
  status        PrinterStatus @default(ONLINE)
  isDefault     Boolean  @default(false)
  priority      Int      @default(0) // Higher = preferred
  maxQueueSize  Int      @default(50)

  // Ink/Toner tracking
  blackToner    Int      @default(100) // percentage
  cyanToner     Int      @default(100)
  magentaToner  Int      @default(100)
  yellowToner   Int      @default(100)

  // Counters
  totalPrints   Int      @default(0)
  totalPages    Int      @default(0)
  lastPrintAt   DateTime?

  shop          Shop     @relation(fields: [shopId], references: [id])
  printJobs     PrintJob[]

  createdAt     DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt     DateTime @updatedAt

  @@index([shopId])
  @@index([status])
}

enum PrinterStatus {
