Potential double-run in React 18 StrictMode: effects run twice in dev; the claim would run twice → second returns 409. In production StrictMode does not double-invoke. Actually StrictMode double-invokes effects in development only. Prod build fine. But to be safe, the 409 would just show an error toast. Hmm, in dev it would show error. But dev isn't how users use it. Still, to be robust, add a ref guard: `const claimedRef = useRef(false);` set true before request; skip if already true. Let me add that to avoid double-claim issues.

