Now I understand the structure. I'll add a `POST /api/guest/orders/:id/payment/verify` endpoint right after the `/payment/initiate` endpoint (line 1202). It will:
1. Find the order
2. Get the shop razorpay config
3. Fetch the payment from Razorpay API
4. If status 'captured', call completeOrderWithPayment and return updated order
5. Otherwise return the payment status (not an error, since webhook may not have fired yet)

Also fix the frontend:
1. Step3Review: accept & render `processingPayment` and `paymentError` props so errors are visible.
2. Maybe show a processing state on the Place Order button for online.

Let me also verify how the frontend uses the result of verify — `verifyRazorpayPayment` sets `setUploadedOrder(result.data)` and `setActiveStep(3)`. So verify must return the updated order object (with files). `completeOrderWithPayment` doesn't return the order; I'll fetch it after.

Let me now write the verify endpoint. I need the payment fetch: `razorpay.payments.fetch(paymentId)` returns payment with `.status` ('captured' | 'failed' | 'authorized' | ...). For UPI intent, typically status 'captured' directly.

Code:

```js
// Verify a Razorpay payment after checkout success (UPI Intent flow)
app.post('/api/guest/orders/:id/payment/verify', asyncHandler(async (req, res) => {
  const { id } = req.params;
  const { paymentId } = req.body;

  if (!paymentId) throw new AppError('paymentId is required', 400, 'MISSING_PAYMENT_ID');

  const order = await prisma.order.findUnique({
    where: { id },
    include: { files: true }
  });
  if (!order) throw new AppError('Order not found', 404, 'ORDER_NOT_FOUND');

  const shop = await prisma.shop.findUnique({ where: { id: order.shopId } });
  if (!shop) throw new AppError('Shop not found', 404, 'SHOP_NOT_FOUND');

  const razorpayConfig = shop.settings?.paymentGatewayConfig?.razorpay;
  if (!razorpayConfig?.enabled || !razorpayConfig?.keyId || !razorpayConfig?.keySecret) {
    throw new AppError('Razorpay not configured for this shop', 400, 'GATEWAY_NOT_CONFIGURED');
  }

  const razorpay = new Razorpay({
    key_id: razorpayConfig.keyId,
    key_secret: decrypt(razorpayConfig.keySecret)
  });

  const payment = await razorpay.payments.fetch(paymentId);

  if (payment.status === 'captured') {
    await completeOrderWithPayment(order.id, payment.id, payment.order_id);
    const updated = await prisma.order.findUnique({
      where: { id: order.id },
      include: { files: true }
    });
    return res.json({ success: true, data: updated });
  }

  if (payment.status === 'failed') {
    await prisma.order.update({
      where: { id: order.id },
      data: { paymentStatus: 'FAILED', paymentFailureReason: payment.error_description || 'Payment failed' }
    });
