Let me reconsider. I could run a quick Express test locally WITHOUT the DB — just to verify the middleware order doesn't break JSON parsing. Actually, I can create a minimal test that replicates the middleware setup: rawBody middleware (path-scoped) + express.json + a test route, then POST JSON. That would confirm my code structure is fine.

