The cleanest: restrict to UPI only via `method: { upi: {} }` + hide the others. Razorpay will show the UPI section which prominently lists Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm, and other apps (or VPA entry). That satisfies the user's request as much as Razorpay allows.

