Review these recent changes for potential regressions:

| Fix | File | Potential Impact |
|-----|------|-----------------|
| Removed `pagesPerSheet: 1` from upload defaults | `server.js:947` | Allows n-Up printing, but `settings.pagesPerSheet` might be undefined |
